abstract: >-
  The dissemination of post-PhD theoretical research demands mathematically rigorous verification and permanent, multi-channel deployment. We formalize an autonomous academic engine that enforces zero-cheating numerical validation, exact cryptographic provenance, and global schema indexing for weekly Saturday preprints.
